  disarms) and KEY learn for the SOUND destination (Shift + white click arms when the row's
  destination is snd, white click alone disarms; while armed every pressed key is traced via
  toast and the T1..T4 / Shift+T1..T4 keys set the slot). Shift + red click deletes the row
