- v6.1 (2026-10-28): Shift + red turn selects WHICH TRACKS the fade affects: ALL, 1, 2, 3, 4,
  1+2, 3+4 (per row, MM2_FM_*; setting packed in the row, 0 = ALL). The fade engine only ramps
  the masked tracks; a MUTE action with a fade now ramps down, toggles at silence and ramps back
