- v4 (2026-10-28): control map reworked per user feedback (no permanent header displays).
  Blue: click cycles the source type; Shift + click toggles MIDI learn ON/OFF; turn = source
  number; Shift + turn = global MIDI channel — while Shift is held, the cursor row's type column
